      "difficulty": "Easy",
      "prompt": "$\\int \\sin^2 x\\cos x\\,dx=?$\nA) $\\frac{\\sin^3 x}{3}+C$\nB) $\\frac{\\cos^3 x}{3}+C$\nC) $\\sin^3 x+C$\nD) $-\\frac{\\cos^3 x}{3}+C$",
